## Changes Made

### UI - Sidebar Navigation

#### [compliance.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/compliance.html)

Added the "Uncertainty" link to the sidebar navigation to match the structure of other pages. I also updated the compliance information to reflect the recent implementation of ISO 14064-1 requirements:
- Updated the ISO 14064-1 score to **95%** and status to **"Near-Full Compliance"**.
- Moved **"Audit Trail"** and **"Uncertainty Assessment"** to the **"Compliant Elements"** list.
- Added **"Organizational Boundaries"** to the **"Compliant Elements"** list.
- Refined the remaining gaps to focus on **"Base Year Recalculation"** and **"Verification Framework"**.

